    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LA_1RC0RB_1LC1LD_0LA0RC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LA_1RC0RB_1LC1LD_0LA0RC p j' E).
    + lia.
